# Sunday summary of the automation fleet (local-weekly-digest): job
# run/failure counts, drift, pending updates, disk. Always emails — the
# digest is the report and doubles as a weekly heartbeat. Exits 1 only
# when the email could not be delivered.
JOB_SCHEDULE="0 7 * * 0"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-weekly-digest/weekly-digest.sh\" run"
